    "title": "Minnesota early voting off to strong start - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By News ,\n21 hours ago ST. PAUL, Minn. (Learfield) – Early voting is underway in Minnesota, with election officials distributing nearly 385,000 absentee and mail ballots during the first six days. The Secretary of State’s Office says about 8,400 voters have already cast ballots in person, while another 3,900 have returned ballots by mail. Read full article",
